# Repository-local temporary data and authorized Git worktrees
tmp
temp
tmp/worktrees
temp/worktrees

# Trailing-slash duplicates of the two scratch roots above, carried in from
# chore/DEN-3956-tmp-temp-ignores. They are redundant: a pattern without a
# trailing slash already matches directories, so tmp and temp above decide
# every one of these paths. Kept because the branch meant them, not because
# AGENTS.md asks for this form - it does not.
tmp/
temp/
